.SH NAME
lean-update - Synchronize the active profile to .env

.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlean update\fP

.SH DESCRIPTION
Resolve the active profile, including inheritance, and write the resolved environment to .env.

A snapshot of the current .env is taken before replacement. The active profile itself is not changed.

.SH EXAMPLES
  lean update

.SH SEE ALSO
\fBlean(1)\fP, \fBlean-apply(1)\fP, \fBlean-current(1)\fP, \fBlean-restore(1)\fP

